'''Nimue''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 89
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Nimue
|name2 = Neutralization Type Nimue
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neutralization Type Nimue''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Nimue has almost the exact same stats as [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]]. They can be used pretty much the same way. Nimue however, does not have access to a [[True Form]], [[Ultra Form]] or [[Talents]]. Because of that, her usefulness will fall behind harshly as the game progresses.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Backliner}}

